1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:02,730
(Amy:)What are you doing?

2
00:00:02,740 --> 00:00:09,210
(Sheldon:)Using Kolinar to suppress
my anger at that last comment.

3
00:00:09,210 --> 00:00:11,780
(Amy:)Is it possible that your
concern for me at this moment

4
00:00:11,780 --> 00:00:14,380
(Amy:)is motivated by nothing more
than simple jealousy?

5
00:00:15,780 --> 00:00:17,320
(Sheldon:)I hadn't considered that.

6
00:00:18,020 --> 00:00:20,220
(Sheldon:)Give me a moment.

7
00:00:22,320 --> 00:00:23,620
(Sheldon:)All right, I've considered it.

8
00:00:23,620 --> 00:00:26,420
(Amy:)And?
I reject it.

9
00:00:26,430 --> 00:00:29,360
(Amy:)You reject it because
you don't feel jealousy,

10
00:00:29,360 --> 00:00:31,500
(Amy:)or because you are
suppressing jealousy?

11
00:00:32,970 --> 00:00:35,500
(Sheldon:)I think
I'll eat my lunch at home.

12
00:00:37,370 --> 00:00:38,870
(Amy:)That's not your
lunch, Sheldon;

13
00:00:38,870 --> 00:00:42,270
(Amy:)those are the cadaver
brain specimens.

14
00:00:42,270 --> 00:00:43,640
(Bernadette:)Oh.

15
00:00:43,640 --> 00:00:46,390
(Sheldon:)As they were incorrectly sliced,

16
00:00:46,400 --> 00:00:49,610
(Sheldon:)you can see how I could
mistake them for my sashimi.

17
00:00:57,780 --> 00:00:59,100
(Amy:)Hello.

